  "matches": [],
  "answer": "I found no earlier ticket that reports this problem, which is Quick Accent turning on Caps Lock when Keyboard Manager swaps Backspace and Caps Lock. The tickets I found were about different problems. #1692 is about the Caps Lock indicator light under Keyboard Manager, and #25435 is about Caps Lock turning on when it is remapped to Ctrl. Neither mentions Quick Accent. Please keep this ticket open as a new bug. Include your exact Keyboard Manager remaps (Backspace→Caps Lock and Caps Lock→Backspace), the Quick Accent activation key and language, and a bug report ZIP. In the meantime, you can avoid the problem by turning off either the Backspace/Caps Lock swap or Quick Accent. Another option is to do the swap outside PowerToys, for example with a registry scancode map, so Quick Accent doesn't interact with it."
 },
